{
  "id": "1CO.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Jo-Korintho 14",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mich mag koro wach kod wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luwuru hera, kendo dwaruru mondo ubed gi mich mag chuny, to moloyo beduru johul wach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech ngʼat ma wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore ok wuo gi ji, to owuoyo gi Nyasaye, nikech onge ngʼama winjo tiend gima owacho. Owacho weche mopondo modhiero ngʼeyo gi teko mar Roho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ngʼat ma hulo wach, wuoyo gi ji mondo ogergi, ojiwgi kendo oduog chunygi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngʼat ma wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore gerore kende owuon, to ngʼat ma hulo wach moa kuom Nyasaye gero kanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daher mondo uwuo gi dhok mayoreyore uduto, to moloyo mano, ni mondo uhul wach. Ngʼat ma hulo wach duongʼ moloyo ngʼat ma wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore makmana ka nitie ngʼat manyalo loko tiend wach modhumono, mondo kanisni duto oyud konyruok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro, jowetena, uparo ni ka abiro iru mi awuoyonu gi dhok mayoreyore, en konyruok mane ma duyudi, ka ok akelonu fweny moro kata ngʼeyo, kata wach mihulo kata puonj?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mana gik maonge ngima kuomgi, kaka asili, kata nyatiti, to dingʼe ywakgi nadi ka ok ipogo dwondgi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To bende, ka turumbete ok ogo gi dwol mongʼere, ngʼama diikre ni lweny?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chal kamano kuomu un bende. Ka ok ukonyoru gi weche maliw ma ji duto winjo, to ngʼama biro ngʼeyo tiend gima uwacho? Wecheu biro lal nono mana ka yamo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongʼere ni nitiere dhok mopogore opogore e piny, to onge kata achiel kuomgi maonge gi tiendgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ok apogo dwond ngʼato, to achalone jamwa, kendo en bende ochalona jamwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emomiyo un bende kaka udwaro mondo ubed gi mich mag Roho, temuru matek moloyo mondo unwangʼ mich mago magero kanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano, ngʼat ma wuoyo gi dhok moro amora ma ji kia, olem mondo obed gi nyalo mar loko tiend gik mowacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech ka alamo gi dhok mayoreyore, to chunya ema alamogo, to pacha ok ti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To koro kara atim angʼo? Abiro lamo gi chunya, to bende abiro lamo gi pacha, abiro wer gi chunya, to bende abiro wer gi pacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka upako Nyasaye gi chunyu, to ere kaka ngʼato manie dieru ma ok winji dhougo digo niya, \"Amin\" bangʼ erokamano mugoyo, ka okia gima uwacho?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyalo bet ni igoyo erokamano maber chuth, to ngʼat machielo ok gerre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adwokone Nyasaye erokamano nikech awuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore moloyo un duto,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to ka an e kind kanisa, to daher wacho weche kata abich kende gi dhok ma ji duto winjo mondo apuonj moloyo weche alufu apar gi dhok mayoreyore ma ji ok winji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowetena, kik ubed nyithindo e pachu, to chaluru nyithindo mayom mana kuom gima rach kende, to e pachu beduru jomadongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ondiki e kitap chik niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "1CO 14:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Anakonyra gi joma wacho dhok mayoreyore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1CO 14:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kendo gi dho joma welo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "1CO 14:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abiro wuoyo gi jogi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1CO 14:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to kata kamano ok giniwinja,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1CO 14:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye ema wacho kamano.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano, mich mar wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore en ranyisi miywayogo joma pok oyie, to ok joma oseyie. Mich mar hulo wach to en mar joma oseyie ok joma pok oyie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo ka kanisa ochokore kaachiel, to ji duto wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore, to ka nitie jomoko ma ok winj dhogino, kata ka joma ok oyie moko odonjo e chokruogno, donge digiwach ni wiu okethore?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ngʼat ma ok oyie, kata ngʼat moro ma ok winj tiend gik miwacho odonjo e chokruoku, to oyudo ka ji duto hulo wach, weche mowinjo nyalo loye gi bura, mi olokre,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo paro malingʼ-lingʼ mopondo e chunye elore e lela, mi opodh auma kolamo Nyasaye, kowacho niya, \"Adier, Nyasaye ni kodu!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chenro mar lemo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowetena, koro wanyalo wacho angʼo? Ka un e chokruok mar lemo, to yudore ni ngʼat moro nigi wer, to ngʼat machielo nigi puonj, to moro nigi fweny, to machielo dwaro wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore kata loko tiend wach miwachono. To gigi duto nyaka tim e yo mochanore magero kanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nitie joma wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore, to ji ariyo kata adek ka ngʼeny kende ema mondo owuo, to mana e yo mochanore maber, ka moro ka moro wuoyo bangʼ wadgi, kendo ngʼato nyaka lok tiend weche ma giwachogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kaonge ngʼato manyalo loko tiend wechego, to ngʼat ma wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore mondo olingʼ e kanisa, to owuo mana e chunye owuon kende gi Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joma hulo wach kik bed mokalo ji ariyo kata adek, kendo ka giwuoyo, to ji mamoko onon mos ka bende weche magiwacho owinjore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ngʼato moro manie chokruokno omi wach moro mopondo mondo owachi, ngʼat mane oyudo dhi nyime gi wuoyo nyaka lingʼ mondi, eka owuo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech un duto unyalo hulo wach, ka ngʼato ka ngʼato koro bangʼ nyawadgi, mondo ji duto oyud puonj kod jip.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho mar janabi niginyalo mar gengʼo wach ma odwaro wacho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikech Nyasaye ok en Nyasach koko, to en Nyasach kwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1CO 14:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To mana kaka timore ei kanisa mar jomaler,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jomamon onego olingʼ e kanisa. Ok oyienigi wuoyo, nyaka giwinj puonj mana ka gilingʼ kaka chik wacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gidwaro mondo olernigi tiend wach moro, to gipenj chwogi giwegi dala, nikech en wichkuot ka dhako wuoyo e kanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro kuparo ni un ema ne wach Nyasaye ochakore kuomu? Koso ugalo ni un kendu ema wach osechoponu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ngʼato okawore ni en jahul wach kata ni en gi mich mar Roho, to nyaka oyie ni wach mandikonuni en chik Ruoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ngʼato ok orwako puonjnani, to en bende ok norwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano, jowetena, gomburu bedo johul wach, to kik utam ji wuoyo gi dhok mayoreyore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timuru gik moko duto e yo mowinjore kendo mochanore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
